---
kind: lore
id: neap
title: The neap tide
---
/* Two dives in every six the tide runs low. Tavi notices first. */

<entry id="neapTavi" on="talk" target="npc.tavi" category="bark" title="Low water" priority="25" once="season:neap" when="@neapLive">
  @tavi{code="0010" emotion="delighted"}: Neap tide! The upper halls are dry as my bread. Bring me anything that isn't nailed down.
  @tavi{code="0020" when="has(prev.season.neap.salvage)"}: Last neap you brought up {{prev.season.neap.salvage:plural(one thing|# things)}}. Beat it.
</entry>

<beat id="haul" on="runEnd" also once="false" when="@neapLive && @surfaced">
  @narrator{code="0010"}: Ilo's net comes up heavy: {{occasion.payload.pearls:plural(one pearl|# pearls)}}, and a bell with no clapper.
  ::salvage{what="a drowned bell"}
</beat>
